Qt for Python provides the official set of Python bindings and a binding
generator for bringing the benefits of cross-platform development to
your Python project.

This script builds PySide6, shiboken6, shiboken6-generator and
pyside-tools.

For compatibility reasons you should use the same LLVM version you used
to build qt6. If you didn't use llvm-opt, set LLVM_OPT=OFF.
